<title>USA: FNB Rochester increases dividend.</title>
<headline>FNB Rochester increases dividend.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>FNB Rochester Corp said it declared a cash dividend of $0.07 per share, payable July 31, record July 15.</p>
<p>The company said the dividend represents a $0.02 or 40 percent from its last dividend paid January 31, 1997.</p>
<p>FNB Rochester said these are its first two cash dividends since 1991.</p>
